WEBVTT

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:04.770
<i>Wealth, fame, power...</i>

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.670
<i>Gold Roger,
the King of the Pirates,</i>

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:08.970
<i>attained everything
this world has to offer.</i>

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:12.840
<i>The words he uttered just before
his death drove people to the seas.</i>

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:16.680
<i>My treasure? If you want it,
you can have it!</i>

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>Find it! I left everything
this world has to offer there!</i>

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:27.590
<i>And so men head for the Grand Line
in pursuit of their dreams!</i>

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:31.490
<i>The world has truly entered
a Great Pirate Era!</i>

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:36.860
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:42.770
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:44.100
<i>ONE PIECE!</i>

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:54.620
<i>Compasses only cause delays</i>

00:00:54.620 --> 00:01:00.350
<i>Delirious with fever,
I take the helm</i>

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:10.350
<i>If the dusty treasure map has
been verified, it's not a legend!</i>

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:18.170
<i>When it comes to personal storms,</i>

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:23.480
<i>simply ride aboard
someone else's biorhythm</i>

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:27.150
<i>and pretend it isn't there!</i>

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:32.650
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:38.360
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:44.600
<i>A coin in my pocket,
and do you wanna be my friend?</i>

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:49.970
<i>We are, We are on the cruise!</i>

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:51.040
<i>We are!</i>

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:03.880
Crunch his head for
sure this time!

00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:05.890
Gum-Gum...

00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:08.150
...Hammer!

00:02:15.830 --> 00:02:18.770
Join our crew, Nami! Okay?!

00:02:20.600 --> 00:02:24.370
How about we team up
for our common goal?

00:02:24.370 --> 00:02:26.360
Alright! Fire!

00:02:33.880 --> 00:02:43.150
"Epic Showdown!
Swordsman Zoro vs. Acrobat Cabaji!"

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:49.060
I'm here to kick your ass,
just like I promised!

00:02:57.100 --> 00:02:58.770
Straw Hat?!

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:12.090
How dare you just come waltzing
back here, to Captain Buggy!

00:03:12.090 --> 00:03:16.620
Listen! All I want is the map
and the treasure!

00:03:16.620 --> 00:03:19.260
Yeah, I know.

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:22.000
Young'uns...
Why are you here?!

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:25.330
Stay out of this,
you're outsiders!

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:31.340
This is my fight!
I will protect my town!

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:35.940
I don't need your meddling!

00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:46.420
What the hell?!

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:50.220
Why did you attack the mayor?!

00:03:50.220 --> 00:03:52.030
He was in the way!

00:03:52.030 --> 00:03:53.560
Good thinking.

00:03:53.560 --> 00:03:56.930
No doubt this old man plans
to die otherwise.

00:03:56.930 --> 00:03:59.500
This is for the best.

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:01.400
Don't be crazy!

00:04:01.400 --> 00:04:04.400
There were plenty of other ways
you could've done it!

00:04:08.840 --> 00:04:10.510
Alright, here goes...

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:16.040
Big Nose!

00:04:17.050 --> 00:04:19.790
<i>That's the one thing
you shouldn't say!</i>

00:04:19.790 --> 00:04:22.990
Damn you, you flashy idiot!

00:04:22.990 --> 00:04:25.730
How dare you...

00:04:25.730 --> 00:04:29.160
Flashily fire the Buggy Ball!

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:31.670
Why'd you say that?!
You idiot!

00:04:31.670 --> 00:04:33.200
Hey, Luffy! Run!

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:34.270
That...

00:04:34.270 --> 00:04:36.200
Time to blow up!

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:38.200
...won't work on me!

00:04:39.410 --> 00:04:40.900
Gum-Gum...

00:04:42.680 --> 00:04:44.170
...Balloon!

00:04:46.350 --> 00:04:47.720
What is he?!

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:49.840
Don't tell me the Buggy Ball...

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:54.190
He bounced it back!

00:04:54.190 --> 00:04:56.460
Say something beforehand, geez!

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:57.790
It's coming this way!

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:06.330
Alright!
Now there's fewer enemies!

00:05:06.330 --> 00:05:08.570
What the heck are you?!

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:10.230
You really know how
to freak people out...

00:05:18.550 --> 00:05:22.350
I knew something was weird from
the time you fought that lion!

00:05:22.350 --> 00:05:26.050
No human can do that!
Explain yourself!

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:29.420
What was that balloon-inflatey
thing you just did?!

00:05:29.420 --> 00:05:31.430
The Gum-Gum Balloon!

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:34.090
I'm asking what that is!

00:05:34.090 --> 00:05:35.860
What are you, a monster?!

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:41.600
How dare you flashily try
to do me in...

00:05:46.570 --> 00:05:48.910
He used his henchmen as shields!

00:05:57.750 --> 00:05:59.580
What happened here?!

00:06:02.190 --> 00:06:03.960
You!

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:05.460
Heya!

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:07.190
The Straw Hat guy!

00:06:07.190 --> 00:06:09.460
C- C- Captain Buggy!
Be careful!

00:06:09.460 --> 00:06:11.530
He has Devil Fruit powers too!

00:06:11.530 --> 00:06:13.600
He's a rubber person!

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:14.740
What?!

00:06:14.740 --> 00:06:16.100
Rubber person?!

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:18.710
Yeah! See!

00:06:18.710 --> 00:06:20.540
A Devil Fruit...

00:06:20.540 --> 00:06:23.940
That explains how he bounced
a Buggy Ball back.

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:31.950
This is the greatest insult
we've had since we hoisted our flag...

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:33.050
...Captain.

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:38.030
Oh, Cabaji! I'm so angry
I can't even fart...

00:06:38.030 --> 00:06:41.300
Cabaji! What the hell
did you do to Richie?!

00:06:41.300 --> 00:06:44.200
This cat?
I used it as a shield,

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:46.290
to keep my clothes
from getting dirty.

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:49.330
Richie!

00:06:51.040 --> 00:06:54.070
Hey, Richie! Say something!
Are you all right?!

00:06:58.610 --> 00:07:00.150
Richie!

00:07:00.150 --> 00:07:02.640
Damn you, you bastard!

00:07:05.220 --> 00:07:06.620
Out of the way!

00:07:06.620 --> 00:07:09.280
<i>No, you move!</i>

00:07:14.090 --> 00:07:16.260
Captain Buggy.

00:07:16.260 --> 00:07:18.200
Yes, Cabaji?

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:20.630
Please leave this to me.

00:07:20.630 --> 00:07:23.800
Alright!
Show them your acrobat show!

00:07:29.980 --> 00:07:32.610
I, Acrobat Cabaji,
Chief of Staff,

00:07:32.610 --> 00:07:37.480
take on Captain Buggy's anger!

00:07:39.290 --> 00:07:42.490
<i>I'll clash swords with you.</i>

00:07:42.490 --> 00:07:46.090
It's an honor, Roronoa Zoro...

00:07:46.090 --> 00:07:49.760
To think I would get to slay you,
as a swordsman myself.

00:07:52.100 --> 00:07:55.570
Hey, Zoro! You should really rest!
I'll handle this!

00:07:55.570 --> 00:07:57.740
Stay out of this!

00:07:57.740 --> 00:08:01.840
<i>That's the stab wound
the captain gave him. The fool...</i>

00:08:01.840 --> 00:08:03.870
Acrobat Technique:
Old Man Arsonist!

00:08:13.620 --> 00:08:15.290
What's wrong?
I'm sure...

00:08:15.290 --> 00:08:17.590
<i>...I didn't kick you
that hard...</i>

00:08:17.590 --> 00:08:20.580
He fights dirty, going after
his injury like that!

00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:25.520
Acrobat Technique:
Murder at the Steam Bath!

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:30.740
Acrobat technique, my ass!

00:08:30.740 --> 00:08:32.470
That's just an ordinary
cloud of dust!

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:41.280
He did it again!

00:08:41.280 --> 00:08:46.120
What's wrong? A grown man
moaning is disgraceful!

00:08:46.120 --> 00:08:49.220
Well? Now do you see
how foolish it was...

00:08:49.220 --> 00:08:53.060
...to make an enemy
of the Buggy Pirates?

00:08:56.530 --> 00:09:01.170
He's crazy to fight while
so seriously injured!

00:09:01.170 --> 00:09:05.240
He's hurt so bad it's almost
mystifying that he's still alive!

00:09:05.240 --> 00:09:07.240
Why're you just standing
there watching?!

00:09:07.240 --> 00:09:08.900
He's gonna get killed!

00:09:16.220 --> 00:09:18.520
Roronoa Zoro...

00:09:18.520 --> 00:09:20.590
...is defeated!

00:09:20.590 --> 00:09:22.920
Annoying bastard!

00:09:24.460 --> 00:09:27.090
Is poking my wound...

00:09:27.090 --> 00:09:29.090
...that much fun?!

00:09:32.270 --> 00:09:33.260
Oww!

00:09:37.970 --> 00:09:40.840
W-why didn't you dodge that?!

00:09:40.840 --> 00:09:45.510
Is that enough of
a handicap for you?

00:09:45.510 --> 00:09:50.350
Now I'll show you the difference
in level between you and me!

00:09:52.520 --> 00:09:54.820
So cool!

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:57.420
So this is Roronoa Zoro, huh?

00:09:57.420 --> 00:09:59.230
You think you can mock me...

00:09:59.230 --> 00:10:02.660
My swords aim to be
the world's greatest!

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:07.870
I can't lose even once to anyone
who calls himself a swordsman!

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:09.840
I see...

00:10:09.840 --> 00:10:13.270
A strong resolve keeps you going.

00:10:13.270 --> 00:10:15.840
But never fear.

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:19.750
Wounds as bad as yours will
be more than enough of an excuse...

00:10:19.750 --> 00:10:22.220
...for losing to me!

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:24.850
The hell with that...

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:29.690
If I lose to someone like you
with such light injuries,

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:33.960
I won't have much of
a bright future ahead of me!

00:10:33.960 --> 00:10:36.030
Why, you-!

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:38.360
Do it, Zoro!

00:10:39.600 --> 00:10:41.440
I can't go along with this!

00:10:41.440 --> 00:10:45.770
You pirates can injure yourselves
for all I care!

00:10:45.770 --> 00:10:50.740
It doesn't matter to me whether
you guys win or lose!

00:10:50.740 --> 00:10:54.550
I'm gonna use this chance to swipe
their treasure and get outta here!

00:10:56.320 --> 00:10:59.050
Let's team up again if
we ever get the chance!

00:10:59.050 --> 00:11:01.420
See ya!
Good luck with the fight!

00:11:01.420 --> 00:11:03.520
Yeah! Thanks!

00:11:03.520 --> 00:11:06.430
Taste my ultimate
acrobatic move!

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:13.390
Acrobat Technique:
The Dance of 100 Kamikaze Tops!

00:11:16.900 --> 00:11:21.310
Those aren't normal guys,
that Luffy and Zoro!

00:11:21.310 --> 00:11:24.710
Nothing good'll come from
being involved with them!

00:11:35.060 --> 00:11:37.990
Here we are!

00:11:37.990 --> 00:11:41.430
Now to steal their treasure
and chart and get out of here!

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:49.270
Acrobat Technique:
A Hike in the Mountains!

00:11:50.500 --> 00:11:53.570
Acrobat Technique:
Fireworks in the Cool Summer Breeze!

00:11:53.570 --> 00:11:55.640
Whoa, he's high up!

00:11:55.640 --> 00:11:58.710
Sting of the Unicycle!

00:11:58.710 --> 00:12:01.710
Ground-hugging
Chop-Chop Cannon!

00:12:04.520 --> 00:12:08.390
Cabaji! I'll hold Zoro down!
Finish him off!

00:12:08.390 --> 00:12:09.550
As you wish!

00:12:10.990 --> 00:12:13.150
Damn you guys!

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:21.070
Luffy!

00:12:21.070 --> 00:12:23.400
D-damn you!

00:12:23.400 --> 00:12:28.000
Stay out of Zoro's fight!

00:12:52.430 --> 00:12:57.170
Wow! Look at all this!

00:12:57.170 --> 00:13:00.330
And it's alllll mine!

00:13:04.410 --> 00:13:08.780
What're you doin'
with our treasure, now?!

00:13:08.780 --> 00:13:12.180
<i>Crap! He woke up!</i>

00:13:13.550 --> 00:13:15.720
By Captain Buggy's orders,

00:13:15.720 --> 00:13:17.590
anyone who gets
near here is to be-

00:13:17.590 --> 00:13:20.650
Huh? I'm all out?!

00:13:23.660 --> 00:13:25.100
It hurts!

00:13:25.100 --> 00:13:26.970
W-what?! What's wrong?

00:13:26.970 --> 00:13:29.670
My chest suddenly
started to hurt...

00:13:29.670 --> 00:13:31.330
What?! Your chest?!

00:13:41.920 --> 00:13:43.250
Hah!

00:13:51.960 --> 00:13:53.290
Yes!

00:13:55.200 --> 00:13:57.190
The chart of the Grand Line!

00:14:04.140 --> 00:14:06.310
I can defeat you
easily enough,

00:14:06.310 --> 00:14:08.580
even without
my captain's help!

00:14:08.580 --> 00:14:11.240
Enough... I'm tired...

00:14:14.010 --> 00:14:17.280
Finally given up, have you?

00:14:17.280 --> 00:14:22.260
Though I must say, I'm impressed
you could fight with such injuries.

00:14:22.260 --> 00:14:28.530
I meant I'm tired...
of your crappy-ass acrobatics!

00:14:30.130 --> 00:14:35.000
Then I'll finish you off...

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:37.130
...with my real sword skills!

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:40.470
Die!

00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:43.840
Oni...

00:14:43.840 --> 00:14:45.210
...Giri!

00:14:49.250 --> 00:14:50.580
Cabaji!

00:14:52.090 --> 00:14:55.360
We, the Buggy Pirates,

00:14:55.360 --> 00:14:58.020
beaten by mere sneak thieves...

00:15:01.400 --> 00:15:03.390
We ain't sneak thieves...

00:15:06.730 --> 00:15:08.400
We're pirates!

00:15:10.270 --> 00:15:12.810
Luffy! I'm goin' to sleep now!

00:15:12.810 --> 00:15:15.670
Right! I'll handle the rest!

00:15:22.720 --> 00:15:26.120
I'd expect no less from the notorious
Buggy Pirates' treasure...

00:15:26.120 --> 00:15:28.460
Hauling it is exhausting!

00:15:28.460 --> 00:15:30.790
But with this much treasure-!

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:40.570
Anyways, I gotta get off
this island ASAP!

00:15:52.380 --> 00:15:55.120
You guys are pirates?!

00:15:55.120 --> 00:15:59.150
Yeah! We're going
to the Grand Line!

00:15:59.150 --> 00:16:04.890
That's no simple voyage nameless
bums like you can handle, dimwit!

00:16:04.890 --> 00:16:08.630
What're you gonna do
in the Grand Line, anyway?!

00:16:08.630 --> 00:16:11.120
Go on a sightseeing trip
or something?

00:16:15.540 --> 00:16:18.270
Become King of the Pirates!

00:16:18.270 --> 00:16:20.610
Get real, you flashy idiot!

00:16:20.610 --> 00:16:24.280
You, King of the Pirates?!
Would that make me God, then?!

00:16:24.280 --> 00:16:28.420
<i>I'm gonna be King of the Pirates
and obtain this world's treasures!</i>

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:30.550
Quit your dreaming!

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:32.650
You're annoying.

00:16:32.650 --> 00:16:34.680
Just bring it on already!

00:16:37.190 --> 00:16:41.330
Seeing that straw hat of yours
brings back memories of him...

00:16:41.330 --> 00:16:44.330
...and irritates me!

00:16:44.330 --> 00:16:49.900
Memories of that damn
cheeky red-haired man!

00:16:49.900 --> 00:16:51.240
Red-haired?!

00:16:51.240 --> 00:16:55.210
Red-haired... Does that mean
you know Shanks?!

00:16:55.210 --> 00:16:58.450
Huh? Yeah, but why?

00:16:58.450 --> 00:16:59.750
Where is he now?!

00:16:59.750 --> 00:17:06.250
Dunno! Maybe I know where he is,
or maybe I don't!

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:08.690
What're you talking about?
Are you stupid or something?

00:17:08.690 --> 00:17:11.020
Not as much as you!

00:17:11.020 --> 00:17:16.960
I ain't nice enough of a guy
to just tell you what you wanna know!

00:17:16.960 --> 00:17:19.460
<i>Then I'll make you tell me!</i>

00:17:20.830 --> 00:17:24.500
I'll kill you before
that ever happens!

00:17:24.500 --> 00:17:27.640
I doubt rubber can bounce
back blades...

00:17:27.640 --> 00:17:29.130
Nope, it can't!

00:17:32.350 --> 00:17:35.340
Chop-Chop Rice Cracker!

00:17:37.520 --> 00:17:42.960
Can't move in midair, can you?!

00:17:42.960 --> 00:17:44.290
Can too!

00:17:48.730 --> 00:17:52.630
Oh, quite interesting!

00:17:52.630 --> 00:17:53.970
You, too!

00:17:53.970 --> 00:17:56.630
Gum-Gum Pistol!

00:17:57.670 --> 00:17:59.670
Those are interesting abilities,

00:17:59.670 --> 00:18:02.580
but they leave you wide open!

00:18:02.580 --> 00:18:04.110
I'm gonna carve you up!

00:18:04.110 --> 00:18:05.410
Gum-Gum...

00:18:05.410 --> 00:18:07.380
Chop-Chop Quick Escape!

00:18:07.380 --> 00:18:09.370
...Sickle!

00:18:15.190 --> 00:18:17.210
Not good enough, Gum-Gum!

00:18:22.400 --> 00:18:25.390
Damn, you keep breaking
into pieces!

00:18:28.230 --> 00:18:33.370
W-what a fight...
It's almost like I'm dreaming...

00:18:33.370 --> 00:18:36.040
H-hey, you see that?!

00:18:36.040 --> 00:18:39.180
You dumbass! Keep pretending
to be knocked out!

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:43.980
Get caught up in that, and you'd
never have enough lives to survive!

00:18:43.980 --> 00:18:45.710
Chop-Chop Cannon!

00:18:48.460 --> 00:18:49.790
Separate!

00:18:54.290 --> 00:18:56.960
Well?! Now do you see, runt?!

00:19:05.810 --> 00:19:06.970
You bastard!

00:19:06.970 --> 00:19:12.050
Oh? Was I not supposed to
scratch your face or something?

00:19:12.050 --> 00:19:13.450
How dare you...

00:19:13.450 --> 00:19:17.620
How dare you damage this hat!

00:19:17.620 --> 00:19:18.820
Huh?

00:19:18.820 --> 00:19:20.720
This is my treasure!

00:19:20.720 --> 00:19:24.210
Whoever damages this hat
absolutely must pay!

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:29.900
Yeah. I swore to the person
who gave me this straw hat...

00:19:29.900 --> 00:19:33.070
...that I'd gather
a crew and become a pirate!

00:19:33.070 --> 00:19:37.540
I thought there was nothing
that could faze him...

00:19:37.540 --> 00:19:41.530
To think he could
get this upset...

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:48.210
It would seem that hat
has a history to it.

00:19:48.210 --> 00:19:50.020
That's right!

00:19:50.020 --> 00:19:52.180
Is it that important of a hat?

00:19:58.020 --> 00:19:59.730
If so...

00:19:59.730 --> 00:20:01.560
...then protect it better!

00:20:20.610 --> 00:20:21.950
Shanks!

00:20:24.920 --> 00:20:27.580
Your arm!

00:20:31.930 --> 00:20:34.360
I'll leave this hat with you.

00:20:34.360 --> 00:20:36.800
It's dear to me.

00:20:36.800 --> 00:20:38.790
Take good care of it!

00:20:45.210 --> 00:20:48.700
Come bring it back to me someday!

00:20:50.480 --> 00:20:53.710
Once you've become
a great pirate!

00:20:53.710 --> 00:20:57.380
That's our promise, Luffy!

00:21:06.430 --> 00:21:09.420
How is this old,
tattered hat a treasure?

00:21:11.600 --> 00:21:16.070
Treasure refers to sparkly gold,
silver, and jewels...

00:21:16.070 --> 00:21:19.110
...that displays
its owner's grandeur!

00:21:19.110 --> 00:21:22.840
You call this filthy
straw hat a treasure?

00:21:22.840 --> 00:21:24.500
Cut the crap!

00:21:26.610 --> 00:21:30.150
That's the hat Shanks
and I swore over!

00:21:30.150 --> 00:21:31.450
What?!

00:21:31.450 --> 00:21:34.850
Meaning this is Shanks' hat?!

00:21:34.850 --> 00:21:37.360
No wonder it seemed familiar!

00:21:37.360 --> 00:21:41.460
He always wore this
by my side!

00:21:41.460 --> 00:21:44.100
You and Shanks sailed
on the same ship?!

00:21:44.100 --> 00:21:47.700
Yeah, back when we were
pirates-in-training.

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:49.840
We were comrades.

00:21:49.840 --> 00:21:53.300
That damn detestable,
red-haired bastard!

00:21:55.140 --> 00:21:57.910
Shanks is a great man!

00:21:57.910 --> 00:21:59.750
You, his comrade?!

00:21:59.750 --> 00:22:02.880
Don't compare yourself to him!

00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:05.220
Chop-Chop Quick Escape!

00:22:07.220 --> 00:22:08.550
Hi, I'm Buggy!

00:22:10.890 --> 00:22:14.380
Never say you and Shanks
are comrades ever again!

00:22:17.900 --> 00:22:20.730
I can say whatever
I want about Shanks!

00:22:24.270 --> 00:22:27.760
Tell me! What happened
between you and Shanks!

00:22:29.110 --> 00:22:32.600
Damn it! How dare you
tear up my treasure!

00:22:35.720 --> 00:22:38.620
Do you wanna know that badly?

00:22:38.620 --> 00:22:43.990
He's the one person
I absolutely can't forgive!

00:22:44.990 --> 00:22:48.460
I'll curse him for
the rest of my life!

00:22:48.460 --> 00:22:52.130
I'll never forgive him!

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:06.070
<i>When I was little, I had
a vision of a treasure map</i>

00:23:10.280 --> 00:23:17.220
<i>and I always searched
for that miraculous place</i>

00:23:17.220 --> 00:23:24.390
<i>before someone else could
beat me to it</i>

00:23:26.930 --> 00:23:36.930
<i>If the world is going to change</i>

00:23:38.410 --> 00:23:45.420
<i>before I can even attain my dream</i>

00:23:45.420 --> 00:23:52.490
<i>then take me to the time
when I knew nothing</i>

00:23:52.490 --> 00:24:02.490
<i>so that my memories won't fade</i>
